{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>CutCompanion 是一款結合對話式教練的營養管理 App，會把身體組成目標、活動量與飲食偏好整理成可自行編輯的熱量與營養素計劃，並以文字或相片記錄餐點、追蹤體重與活動數據。適合想有系統地控制飲食、又不想每次自行計算營養數值的人士。原價 US $0.99，目前限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-24.webp\">\n<h2>把營養計劃變成每日習慣</h2>\n<p>首次使用時，對話式引導會按身體組成目標、活動量與飲食偏好，生成可自行修改的熱量及營養素計劃。記錄餐點可輸入文字、上載相片或兩者並用，儲存前先核對 AI 估算的營養數值。每日目標涵蓋熱量、蛋白質、碳水化合物與脂肪，並可追蹤體重趨勢，Apple Health 亦會同步步數與運動分鐘。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-275-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-276-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-277-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-278-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-279-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-280-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：CutCompanion</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T11:40:34.747673+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":346,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:22:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T20:37:59.936510+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T11:37:41.902144+00:00","content_hash":"d824720ebd69c8fedd62d564d23f8b91bde979aa02b84172621f83d134b4d85c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}